# PromptBeast adult pack (18+, optional). Original wording. Every subject is an adult; consensual, affectionate
# or confident themes only. Extend it with your own .pbpack in the user pack folder.
#
# Tiers (untagged lines default to `sensual`)
#   sensual  lingerie, boudoir, implied nudity, smouldering looks
#   nude     artistic and plain nudity, body detail
#   partner  adults being intimate together (non-graphic: embraces, kissing, entwined bodies)
#   explicit sexual acts between consenting adults, named plainly; only drawn when "How far" is set to Explicit
# Merges into the base slots (outfit, setting, pose, ...) so coherence rules apply across both packs.

